993
00:55:18,182 --> 00:55:22,219
And I think it's time
for all y'all to go.

994
00:55:22,252 --> 00:55:24,355
Why?

995
00:55:26,090 --> 00:55:28,225
Because I said so.

996
00:55:28,258 --> 00:55:29,360
(girl laughs)

997
00:55:29,394 --> 00:55:31,295
I'll tell you what,

998
00:55:31,328 --> 00:55:33,498
