1011
00:56:04,194 --> 00:56:06,163
Hey, you.
This is not a slumber party.

1012
00:56:06,196 --> 00:56:10,200
Get out! Get out, you.
Get out, snoop doggies.

1013
00:56:10,234 --> 00:56:11,502
