01:03:17,127 --> 01:03:20,330
OK, kids. We're ready.

1131
01:03:21,999 --> 01:03:24,969
Whoa!

1132
01:03:25,002 --> 01:03:26,937
Wow!

1133
01:03:26,971 --> 01:03:29,206
Oh, my gosh.
(Jenny) Look at that.
Hey, guys.

1134
01:03:29,239 --> 01:03:31,508
Holy cow.
(Jenny) Yeah.

1135
01:03:31,541 --> 01:03:33,477
Oliver, did you
